{
  "displayNarration": "Once internal approval finishes, the Execution Workflow takes over. The owner submits SBSI Review completion, then Client Acceptance; an eligible reviewer confirms each step — or returns it for revision, which pauses the flow and restarts internal approval if the draft changes. At For Signing, the owner either uploads a scanned signed PDF or launches In-App E-Signing to place a signature directly onto the approved draft. A Manager or CEO confirms to mark it Signed, with optional Notarized PDF upload, full Execution History, and post-signing Contract Amendments.",
